*Linear Search:-
-Very simple technique in ds and it finds the key element one by one in the array.
code:-
import java.util.*;
import java.lang.*;
import java.io.*;

// The main method must be in a class named "Main"
class Main {
    public static int findEelement(int arr[],int key){
        for(int i=0;i<arr.length;i++){
            if(arr[i]==key){
                return i;
            }
        }
        return -1;
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int arr[]={2,4,6,8,10};
        int key=6;
        int index=findEelement(arr,key);
        if(index!=-1){
            System.out.println(key+" Element found in "+(index+1)+"th position in the array");
        }
        else{
            System.out.println(key+" Element not found in array");
        }
    }
}
